  "title": "UI: switch back to wiki.wireshark.org, fix some URLs",
  "description": "The GitLab wiki does not have much flexibility over the URLs. Let's move\nit back to our shorter domain, wiki.wireshark.org. That way, we have\nmore control over the redirection process.\n\nOther changes: Remove unused \"TCP Chimney\" that is not referenced\nanywhere. It was originally added in the GTK UI via commit 668723356a96.\nPrefer `Protocols/%1` to redirect short protocol abbreviations, this\nreverts a previous fix for #17944.\n\nRelates to #17999.",
